          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.51.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 51:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 21:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe uhahazwa, ukazungagizwa n’inkūbi y’umuyaga, ntugire ikikuremesha, ehe nzokwubakisha amabuye yitwa simaragido, amatanguriro yawe nzoyubakisha ayitwa safiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iminara yawe nzoyubakisha amabuye atukura, n’ ibirimba vyawe nzovyubakisha amabuye akayangana, kand’ uruzitiro rwawe rwose nzorwubakisha ay’ igiciro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.119.165"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 119:165",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.6.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 6:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bawe bose bazokwigishwa nanje, jewe Uhoraho, kand’ amahoro abana bawe bazogira azoba menshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzoshikamishwa n’ukugororoka; uguhahazwa kuzokuba kure, nta co uzotinya; bo n’ibitera ubgoba, kuko bitazokwēgēra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni hagira abagutera, si jewe nzoba mbagomoye; abazogutera bose bazohindikirana imbere yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe ni jewe ndema umucuzi avuguta umuriro w’amakara, agakūramw’ ico kurwanisha kubg’ ubuhanga bgiwe; ariko kandi naremye umuranduzi wo kugeseza na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta co kurwanisha bācuriye kukurwanya kizogira ico kimara; kand’ ururimi rwose ruzoguhagurukira kukubūranya, uzorutsinda. Ivyo ni vyo mwandu w’abasavyi banje, jewe Uhoraho, kand’ ukwo ni kwo kugororoka kwabo kwanduruka kuri jewe; ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
